{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026awxGWfrgud1792938109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港快運一個飛往韓國的航班，有外置充電器冒煙，一名乘客受傷。</p><p></p><p>香港快運回覆查詢時指，今日由香港前往濟州UO676航班上，一名乘客放置於座位下方的外置充電器，在飛行途中因過熱冒煙，令其手部受傷。</p><p></p><p>機組人員即時按照既定程序處理，把外置充電器放入防火安全袋內，情況受控，其他乘客並未有受傷。</p><p></p><p>航班其後按照原定計劃，於當地時間早上約六時安全降落。受傷乘客落機後，由救護人員檢查並接受進一步治療。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:42.974695+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:10.171208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:26.990640+00:00","content_hash":"c7b00b7d5b086baae49e7ba29b0eac20fc6488ece5e50a62f5bb2a43fbf9365a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:42.974695+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}